  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_End_Edition/BH_MBE_Header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">《中世紀建築》的世界觀隨著這個「終界」新版本進一步擴展。探索五座令人驚嘆的中世紀風格新建築，它們有極高機率出現在終界那些奇幻的群島上。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你熱愛冒險，這款模組絕對是你的首選！因為這些建築內部不僅藏滿寶藏，也佈滿了陷阱與敵對生物。你一定會深深愛上在這維度中的探索體驗！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">別忘記下載《中世紀建築》的主版本！<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/medieval-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">點擊這裡！</span></a></strong><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">下界（Nether）版本的模組也已推出！<strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/medieval-buildings-nether-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">點擊這裡！</span></a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要伺服器才能和朋友一起遊玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_End_Edition/BH_MBE_Promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你正在尋找一個伺服器，讓你能與朋友暢玩各種模組或整合包，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Bisect Hosting</strong></a> 就是你的最佳選擇！他們提供極具性價比的 Minecraft 伺服器，只要點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此連結</strong></a> 並輸入優惠碼「Lupin」，即可享有 25% 折扣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_End_Edition/BH_MBE_Summary.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">本模組為終界維度新增了五座建築，全部採用中世紀風格設計，能完美融入你的遊戲世界。更棒的是，它與絕大多數修改終界生成的模組完全兼容！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果你喜歡壯觀的結構、精美的建築，或是懷舊的歷史氛圍，這款模組絕對能為你的遊戲增添色彩。把它加入你的整合包，盡情體驗嶄新的終界建築風貌吧！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">所有建築均由：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/emberunholy/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">emberunholy</a> 負責設計&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;comic sans ms&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a> 模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_End_Edition/BH_MBE_Faq.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>與其他新增建築的模組兼容嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">毫無疑問，它與其他任何模組（無論是建築模組還是生物群落模組）都能完美兼容。不過在生物群落方面，這些建築只會生成於特徵與原設相似的地形中。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>新建築會出現在哪裡？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">僅限於終界維度，也就是擊敗末影龍後可進入的那些群島。它們會依照特定參數隨機生成，確保不會過於密集。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>伺服器端支援嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然可以！運作完全正常！記得與朋友搭配模組遊玩的最佳選擇就是 BisectHosting，只要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>點擊此連結</strong></a> 即可享有 25% 折扣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>允許用於整合包嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！前提是該模組僅發布於 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 平台。擅自上傳至其他任何平台皆屬侵權行為，嚴格禁止。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不過，如果你願意將本模組收錄於你的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 整合包中，我們將不勝感激。若有任何微調需求或疑問，歡迎隨時聯繫我們！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以錄製關於此模組的影片並發布在我的頻道嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！你完全可以自由地在頻道中實況本模組或我們的任何整合包，並製作相關影片。事實上，我們非常樂見並感謝你的分享！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_End_Edition/BH_MBE_Screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/710/medieval-buildings.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/712/medieval-buildings-4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/713/medieval-buildings-5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/714/medieval-buildings-7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/810/716/medieval-buildings-8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1621\" height=\"912\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></span></a></span></p>",
